WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.032
Negative numbers lie to the left of zero; the number farther right is greater, even

00:00:05.032 --> 00:00:06.643
if it has fewer digits.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:14.010
Compare the integers: -22 blank 24. The answer is less than . On a number line, -22

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.325
is to the left of 24.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.794
At a weather station at a farm, two readings are -1 degrees C and 26 degrees C. Which

00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:27.824
sign makes -1 blank 26 true? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:34.732
At a weather station at a farm, two readings are -1 degrees C and 26 degrees C. Which

